```json
{"summary": "In this room, looking from the entrance, two sleek black clothing racks made with powder-coated metal are placed parallel to each other, with an industrial pendant light hung centrally above clothing rack 1. Adjacent to a matte gray drawer cabinet made with engineered wood, a neutral-toned shelf unit made with reclaimed wood is positioned, while another shelf unit is mounted above a charcoal gray bench made with faux leather and metal legs. A third shelf unit is installed next to a frameless full-length mirror made with polished glass, which is leaned against the wall beside a soft white jewelry organizer made with velvet-lined wood. The drawer cabinet is positioned 0.5 meters away from a dark brown shoe rack made with wrought iron, which is placed under a matte black hanging rod made with steel. Another hanging rod is installed parallel to the first and placed 0.3 meters above a woven beige storage bin made with natural jute. The jewelry organizer is mounted on the wall next to a storage bin, which is stacked on top of another storage bin positioned under the first shelf unit. Two additional storage bins are placed beside each other, with one next to the bench."}
```

